# MATTER_CAM_PATH for the M1d fly-through determinism gate (lod_trace_diff.py).
# World: RockGallery -- 13 authored rock instances from a 0.12 m pebble to a
# 6 m boulder, no streamed terrain, so every instance_token is stable across
# runs (see the M1d notes in docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-04-lod-vt-migration.md).
